{"4520410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Umbral Briar", "steam_appid": 4520410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadowed wilds where thorn and twilight entwine, <strong>Umbral Briar</strong> invites you into a living world that does not forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras/d358b5670f8ba56a3588ebea4e3a00d1.avif?t=1787683775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras_big/d358b5670f8ba56a3588ebea4e3a00d1.webp?t=1787683775 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark fantasy multiplayer online RPG built on the soul of the classics—where your journey is defined not by fleeting systems, but by lasting choices, meaningful progression, and a world that evolves without erasing its past. Inspired by the depth and community of old-school RPGs, <i>Umbral Briar</i> modernizes combat with fluid responsiveness and tactical weight, while preserving the deliberate pacing and identity that made the genre timeless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras/4dc89586a5cba4fd1d1509200ca3569f.avif?t=1787683775\" alt=\"An orc sits by a campfire in the rain, taking in the ambiance and longing for the journey ahead\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras_big/4dc89586a5cba4fd1d1509200ca3569f.webp?t=1787683775 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no quest hubs cluttered with exclamation marks. No checklist-driven design. In <i>Umbral Briar</i>, your character already knows what matters. The world itself is the quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A village plagued by something unseen. A forest that grows wrong. A ruin whispering beneath the soil. You don’t accept these quests—you discover them. And when you act, the world responds. NPCs recognize your deeds not because you spoke to them first, but because you chose to intervene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras/23ece913ec65cf3bc510f677afd2fc75.avif?t=1787683775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras_big/23ece913ec65cf3bc510f677afd2fc75.webp?t=1787683775 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is horizontal and enduring. When the world expands, it expands outward—not upward. New lands bring new opportunities, not obsolescence. Your hard-earned gear, your crafted tools, your knowledge of the world—these remain relevant. Always. There are no seasonal resets, no artificial cycles that wipe your progress clean. What you build in <i>Umbral Briar</i> stays built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras/e1ccc4800ac2c65e0816df3c96f9b44e.avif?t=1787683775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras_big/e1ccc4800ac2c65e0816df3c96f9b44e.webp?t=1787683775 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At max level, the journey doesn’t end—it deepens. Old dungeons don’t become irrelevant relics; they become shared history. Whether you return for rare materials, hidden secrets, or simply to help a friend experience something meaningful, the world rewards continued exploration and cooperation across all levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professions matter. Exploration matters. Community matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no microtransactions. No pay-to-win shortcuts. No fear of missing out. Nothing is designed to disappear. The game respects your time by ensuring that everything you do has permanence and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras/cc2d11113941c260afd40f9f88626a1a.avif?t=1787683775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras_big/cc2d11113941c260afd40f9f88626a1a.webp?t=1787683775 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Umbral Briar</i> is not a race to the endgame. It is a world to live in—one that remembers where you’ve been, what you’ve done, and who you’ve become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Umbral Briar. It's almost time for you to awaken.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadowed wilds where thorn and twilight entwine, <strong>Umbral Briar</strong> invites you into a living world that does not forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras/d358b5670f8ba56a3588ebea4e3a00d1.avif?t=1787683775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras_big/d358b5670f8ba56a3588ebea4e3a00d1.webp?t=1787683775 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark fantasy multiplayer online RPG built on the soul of the classics—where your journey is defined not by fleeting systems, but by lasting choices, meaningful progression, and a world that evolves without