 gear, your crafted tools, your knowledge of the world—these remain relevant. Always. There are no seasonal resets, no artificial cycles that wipe your progress clean. What you build in <i>Umbral Briar</i> stays built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras/e1ccc4800ac2c65e0816df3c96f9b44e.avif?t=1787683775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras_big/e1ccc4800ac2c65e0816df3c96f9b44e.webp?t=1787683775 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At max level, the journey doesn’t end—it deepens. Old dungeons don’t become irrelevant relics; they become shared history. Whether you return for rare materials, hidden secrets, or simply to help a friend experience something meaningful, the world rewards continued exploration and cooperation across all levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professions matter. Exploration matters. Community matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no microtransactions. No pay-to-win shortcuts. No fear of missing out. Nothing is designed to disappear. The game respects your time by ensuring that everything you do has permanence and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras/cc2d11113941c260afd40f9f88626a1a.avif?t=1787683775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/extras_big/cc2d11113941c260afd40f9f88626a1a.webp?t=1787683775 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Umbral Briar</i> is not a race to the endgame. It is a world to live in—one that remembers where you’ve been, what you’ve done, and who you’ve become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Umbral Briar. It's almost time for you to awaken.</p>", "short_description": "Dark fantasy online RPG featuring modern combat and classic RPG progression. Explore, complete objectives through action instead of quest hubs, and build lasting power through horizontal progression. No resets, no pay-to-win—just cooperative dungeon crawling, professions, and meaningful exploration.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/c5f0aa204e138034353da5f402115ea2e6d782d8/header.jpg?t=1787683775", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/253b84a27304155bd164657b95d7fbd985f6e684/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787683775", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4520410/253b84a27304155bd164657b95d7fbd985f6e684/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787683775", "website": "https://umbralbriar.netlify.app/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Revenant Games"], "publishers": ["Revenant Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 20, "description": "MMO"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online C